<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh Apex Tannery 96 net profit falls 8.8pct.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh Apex Tannery 96 net profit falls 8.8pct.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended on June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(In million taka unless stated)</p>
<p>				  1996		1995</p>
<p>    Net profit		 40.2    vs	44.1</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   49.8    vs	53.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,092.3   vs    1,115.1</p>
<p>    Dividend   30 taka per 100-taka share vs 30 taka.</p>
<p>Note :The company announced the result at its annual general meeting on Monday. It said the profit and turnover dropped in the year because of political turmoil which disrupted production and export</p>
</text>
